%% Incident response lifecycle (Task 4).
flowchart TB
    DET["Detection\n(max-capacity + p99 alert)"] --> ACK["Acknowledgement\n(02:47, page acked)"]
    ACK --> TRIAGE["Triage\n(severity, IC, channel)"]
    TRIAGE --> DIAG["Diagnosis\n(business -> ECS -> net -> Aurora -> external -> changes)"]
    DIAG --> MIT["Mitigation\n(conditional, evidence-based)"]
    MIT --> STAB["Stabilization\n(recovery criteria sustained 15-30 min)"]
    STAB --> RECON["Transaction reconciliation\n(no duplicate debits/credits)"]
    RECON --> CLOSE["Closure\n(remove temp mitigations, reconcile Terraform drift)"]
    CLOSE --> PM["Postmortem\n(blameless)"]
    PM --> CA["Corrective actions\n(mapped to confirmed root cause)"]

    MIT -. not recovering .-> DIAG
    STAB -. regression .-> MIT
